[54.032264, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll first inspect the system for existing users/groups, ACL tools, and the state of `/srv/shared` before applying the required configuration.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -x\r\nid\r\ngetent group research || true\r\ngetent passwd alice || true\r\ngetent passwd bob || true\r\ncommand -v setfacl || true\r\ncommand -v getfacl || true\r\nls -ld /srv /srv/shared 2>&1 || true\r\nfindmnt -T /srv -o TARGET,FSTYPE,OPTIONS 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[54.032437, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[54.047126, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[54.047929, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n+ id\r\nuid=0(root) gid=0(root) groups=0(root)\r\n+ getent group research\r\nresearch❌1001:alice,bob\r\n+ getent passwd alice\r\nalice❌1001:1002::/home/alice:/bin/bash\r\n+ getent passwd bob\r\nbob❌1002:1003::/home/bob:/bin/bash\r\n+ command -v setfacl\r\n/usr/bin/setfacl\r\n+ command -v getfacl\r\n/usr/bin/getfacl\r\n+ ls -ld /srv /srv/shared\r\nls: cannot access '/srv/shared': No such file or directory\r\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root 4096 Apr  4  2025 /srv\r\n+ true\r\n+ findmnt -T /srv -o TARGET,FSTYPE,OPTIONS\r\nTARGET FSTYPE  OPTIONS\r\n/      overlay \r\nrw,relatime,lowerdir=/var/lib/docker/overlay2/l/I6HGNX3FRVVHGVGBXQABLNWJ2X:/var/lib/docker/overlay2/l/UUYKR6J7KBZY3Z6FQ63GV5SHLT:/var/lib/docker/overlay2/l/F2RC\r\nDHJE37A56WERTWNJE2HPRW:/var/lib/docker/overlay2/l/KPUJKQPUQH2ZDA3AW6PJTOHIYG:/var/lib/docker/overlay2/l/CMMQIXQ2LDWFETDHEY2PI6IURM:/var/lib/docker/overlay2/l/6C\r\nKMZWNDLJTRJXOMGTCSPMVEYI,upperdir=/var/lib/docker/overlay2/1a2b5ed2809f59c575b0b82c1e5153fe30b095f9e3b8901f258125280144899b/diff,workdir=/var/lib/docker/overlay\r\n2/1a2b5ed2809f59c575b0b82c1e5153fe30b095f9e3b8901f258125280144899b/work,nouserxattr\r\n\r\n"]
