[62.697379, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[62.750435, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m2\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[62.752877, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe `research` group already exists with both users as members, and the ACL tools are available. I’ll now create the directory, set ownership/setgid/base mode, \r\napply the current and default ACLs, and verify them.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\nmkdir -p /srv/shared\r\nchgrp research /srv/shared\r\nchmod 2770 /srv/shared\r\nsetfacl -m g:research:rwx,u:alice:rwx,u:bob:rwx,o::---,m::rwx /srv/shared\r\nsetfacl -d -m g:research:rwx,u:alice:rwx,u:bob:rwx,o::---,m::rwx /srv/shared\r\n# Re-assert base mode (does not remove ACLs; ensures setgid and group permission bits)\r\nchmod 2770 /srv/shared\r\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- stat ---'\r\nstat -c 'path=%n owner=%U group=%G mode=%a (%A)' /srv/shared\r\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- getfacl ---'\r\ngetfacl -p /srv/shared\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[62.753035, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[62.766836, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[62.767135, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- stat ---\r\npath=/srv/shared owner=root group=research mode=2770 (drwxrws---)\r\n--- getfacl ---\r\n# file: /srv/shared\r\n# owner: root\r\n# group: research\r\n# flags: -s-\r\nuser::rwx\r\nuser:alice:rwx\r\nuser:bob:rwx\r\ngroup::rwx\r\ngroup:research:rwx\r\nmask::rwx\r\nother::---\r\ndefault:user::rwx\r\ndefault:user:alice:rwx\r\ndefault:user:bob:rwx\r\ndefault:group::rwx\r\ndefault:group:research:rwx\r\ndefault😷:rwx\r\ndefault:other::---\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[62.767896, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[62.767979, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
