[78.366472, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m3\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[78.367243, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe directory now has mode `2770`, ownership group `research`, and the required current/default ACLs with `mask::rwx`. I’ll validate effective access for the \r\nintended users and deny access for a non-member, without creating any files in the shared directory.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -u\r\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- group membership ---'\r\ngetent group research\r\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- access checks ---'\r\nfor user in alice bob; do\r\n  if runuser -u \"$user\" -- test -w /srv/shared && runuser -u \"$user\" -- test -x /srv/shared; then\r\n    echo \"$user: allowed (rwx effective access)\"\r\n  else\r\n    echo \"$user: DENIED (unexpected)\"\r\n  fi\r\ndone\r\nif runuser -u daemon -- test -x /srv/shared 2>/dev/null; then\r\n  echo \"daemon (outside research): allowed (unexpected)\"\r\nelse\r\n  echo \"daemon (outside research): denied (expected)\"\r\nfi\r\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- ACL presence checks ---'\r\nrequired_current='user:alice:rwx|user:bob:rwx|group::rwx|group:research:rwx|mask::rwx|other::---'\r\nrequired_default='default:user:alice:rwx|default:user:bob:rwx|default:group::rwx|default:group:research:rwx|default😷:rwx|default:other::---'\r\nacl=$(getfacl -p /srv/shared)\r\nfor entry in $(printf '%s' \"$required_current|$required_default\" | tr '|' ' '); do\r\n  if printf '%s\\n' \"$acl\" | grep -Fxq \"$entry\"; then\r\n    echo \"OK: $entry\"\r\n  else\r\n    echo \"MISSING: $entry\"\r\n  fi\r\ndone\r\nprintf '%s\\n' '--- final mode/ownership ---'\r\nstat -c 'owner=%U group=%G mode=%a (%A)' /srv/shared\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[78.368743, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[78.418859, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[78.419217, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- group membership ---\r\nresearch❌1001:alice,bob\r\n--- access checks ---\r\nalice: allowed (rwx effective access)\r\nbob: allowed (rwx effective access)\r\ndaemon (outside research): denied (expected)\r\n--- ACL presence checks ---\r\nOK: user:alice:rwx\r\nOK: user:bob:rwx\r\nOK: group::rwx\r\nOK: group:research:rwx\r\nOK: mask::rwx\r\nOK: other::---\r\nOK: default:user:alice:rwx\r\nOK: default:user:bob:rwx\r\nOK: default:group::rwx\r\nOK: default:group:research:rwx\r\nOK: default😷:rwx\r\nOK: default:other::---\r\n--- final mode/ownership ---\r\nowner=root group=research mode=2770 (drwxrws---)\r\n\r\n"]
[78.420981, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
