[83.109174, "o", "\r\u001b[2KAll requirements are verified: `/srv/shared` is group-owned by `research`, has the setgid bit with mode `2770`, current and default ACLs grant full access to \r\n`research`, alice, and bob while denying others, and the ACL mask permits full permissions. No files were created in the shared directory.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[83.109519, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
